OL,3,GNEWSAPolice seek 'significant witness'
OL,4,Ain Sunbury stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are seeking a "significant
OL,7,Fwitness" after a stabbing in Surrey
OL,8,Fwhich saw two people hurt.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at a property on
OL,11,FVicarage Road in Sunbury shortly after
OL,12,F14.30 BST on Thursday.
OL,14,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of affray and taken to
OL,16,Fhospital, along with a second man in
OL,17,Fhis 50s. Both were treated for
OL,18,F"injuries consistent with a stabbing",
OL,19,FSurrey Police said.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
